# Default-deny build context: credentials, local history, caches, and alternate
# implementations never enter the build. Only Dockerfile COPY sources are allowed.
**
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!requirements-runtime.lock
!src/
!src/crossword_agent/
!src/crossword_agent/**
!data/
!data/**
!artifacts/
!artifacts/evaluation/
!artifacts/evaluation/report.json
!artifacts/user-puzzles/
!artifacts/user-puzzles/manifest.json
!artifacts/user-puzzles/*.puzzle.json
!artifacts/user-puzzles/*.result.json
!artifacts/user-puzzles/*.verification.json

# Keep generated Python files and nested environment files out of allowed trees.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.env
**/.env.*
